STILL RECORDING, tape 13: "Monitor 7" (2026). Halloway Archive. Original story, pictures, sound and music. A work of fiction.

Pictures: drawn in code (canvas 2D) with the tape kit (channel/brand/tapekit.js): a 2.5D renderer, CCTV grading, the handheld camcorder look and VHS damage. The tiled room on CAM 07 (lit by its swinging bulb), the service corridor of level B, the floor plan, and the figure in the corner and the one hanging from the ceiling (soft black silhouettes in the style of the kit's 'broken' figure) are drawn for this tape (film.js).
Fonts: VT323 (The VT323 Project Authors), SIL Open Font License 1.1. Special Elite (Astigmatic), Apache License 2.0.
Voice: ElevenLabs text-to-speech, model eleven_v4. Leon Marsh: "HA Leon Marsh" (ElevenLabs Voice Design, made for this series).
Sound effects: generated with ElevenLabs Sound Effects (prompts in sfx/prompts.json).
Music: none. A low drone made from the service level's own ventilation (tools/score.py).
Sound: every sound is in the service corridor or the room on CAM 07, heard through Leon's camcorder or the camera's microphone (tools/mix.py).
